.SS "int sc_scda_proc_sizes (\fBsc_array_t\fP * elem_sizes, \fBsc_array_t\fP * elem_counts, \fBsc_array_t\fP * proc_sizes, \fBsc_scda_ferror_t\fP * errcode)"

.PP
This is a collective function to determine the processor sizes\&. The purpose of this function is determine the \fBproc_sizes\fP argument as required by \fBsc_scda_fread_varray_data\fP given the data that can be retrieved by calling \fBsc_scda_fread_varray_sizes\fP or as required by \fBsc_scda_fwrite_varray\fP given \fBelem_sizes\fP and \fBelem_counts\fP as passed to \fBsc_scda_fwrite_varray\fP\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
All parameters are collective\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBWarning\fP
.RS 4
The API of this function will change in the next libsc version!
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIelem_sizes\fP The \fBelem_sizes\fP array as retrieved by \fBsc_scda_fread_varray_sizes\fP or passed to \fBsc_scda_fwrite_varray\fP\&. 
.br
\fIelem_counts\fP The \fBelem_counts\fP array as retrieved by \fBsc_scda_fread_varray_sizes\fP or passed to \fBsc_scda_fwrite_varray\fP\&. 
.br
\fIproc_sizes\fP A \fBsc_array\fP with element size \fBsc_scda_ulong\fP that is resized on output to the length of \fBelem_sizes\fP and \fBelem_counts\fP\&. The array is filled with the number bytes per process\&. 
.br
\fIerrcode\fP An errcode that can be interpreted by \fBsc_scda_ferror_string\fP or mapped to an error class by \fBsc_scda_ferror_class\fP\&. \fBerrcode\fP encodes success if and only if the function does not return NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
0 in case of success and -1 otherwise\&. 
.RE
.PP

